00:23:13.000 --> 00:23:40.000
This was incorrect. It was simply a step police had to take. It didn't mean they were treating it as a homicide. To Betty and Morris' relief, no sign of Peter was found. The media continued to stalk the family. Their front yard was full of reporters and photographers who bombarded them with intrusive and insensitive questions whenever they appeared. Police canvassed the Albemarle Road to see if any residents noticed anyone suspicious in

