00:24:43.000 --> 00:25:11.000
He slept on a cot at police headquarters. Betty and Morris called another press conference. It was held in the backyard of their home. Betty was dry-eyed and emotionally exhausted. Morris stood silently beside her. Covered in a thick blanket behind them was the carriage Peter had been snatched from. Betty said, Once again in desperation, we appeal to you who have our baby. We beg you to let us have word.

