00:25:11.000 --> 00:25:31.000
Is the baby well? Please take care of him. He needs attention so much. We don't want any revenge. We want our baby. Please, please use the church or clergyman to make contact with us. Drop a note in the collection box. The clergymen are all committed to us not to turn over the information to police.

